   "widgets_values": [
    "BRAVIKRON LABS - Consistent Character Sheet (Qwen-Image-2512)\n\n1. Put your character LoRA in models/loras and pick it in 'Your character LoRA'.\n2. Replace 'crump3t' in the prompt with your LoRA's trigger word, and describe the outfit.\n3. Queue. One image = full turnaround + expressions on one sheet.\n\nFAST MODE: select 'Lightning 4-step' and press Ctrl+B to enable it, then set KSampler steps 4, cfg 1.0.\nFULL QUALITY (default): Lightning bypassed, steps 30, cfg 4.0.\n\nModels (all Apache 2.0): qwen_image_2512_fp8_e4m3fn, qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled, qwen_image_vae,\noptional Qwen-Image-2512-Lightning-4steps-V1.0.\n\nWant a custom LoRA of YOUR character? Bravikron Labs - bravikron.com"
